 "sentences": [
  "Scotland's soggy bogs store massive carbon.",
  "These treeless landscapes are called the Flow Country.",
  "Waterlogged soil stops microbes from breaking down dead plants.",
  "Instead, it creates thick, carbon-rich peat layers.",
  "This ecosystem spans 1,900 square kilometers of Highlands.",
  "It holds twice as much carbon as all the world's forests combined.",
  "Now, it's officially a UNESCO World Heritage Site."
